SUMMARY:Rockypalooza
DESCRIPTION:Rockypalooza brings the campus community together on the Quad for a festival-style evening filled with great food\, live entertainment\, student performances\, interactive activities\, games\, and more! Connect with fellow Bulldogs\, explore campus organizations\, celebrate school spirit\, and enjoy a night of music\, fun\, and community. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Accessibility\nUNC Asheville is committed to providing universal access to all of our events. If you have any questions about access or would like to request reasonable accommodations that will facilitate your full participation in the film screenings\, please contact Stephanie Bullick\, Director of Accessibility\, at accessibility@unca.edu.
